id: QUAL-071
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Magic string repeated 3+ times (extract to constant)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: (status|type|role|state)\s*===?\s*['"]\w+['"]
    message: "String comparison for status/type/role — use an enum or constants object to prevent typos"
fix: Define constants. const STATUS = {ACTIVE: 'active', INACTIVE: 'inactive'} then use STATUS.ACTIVE.
